{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scorched Sun is a short experience that combines top down survival horror with turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new initiate, delve into the depths of a monastery of the Scorched Sun order and discover the secrets within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b263ad728c0614692dd6f0aa348d959a.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The order has sent you to investigate why they have lost contact with a monastery set in a small village. Upon arrival, you will notice that the situation is not as simple as you thought.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/af8caa669a3effb955748d905570d0e1.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/f73eeb76c1d31eb380c37f8945a910a3.poster.avif?t=1766056130\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/f73eeb76c1d31eb380c37f8945a910a3.webm?t=1766056130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring, you only see what your character can see. Explore various environments and gather resources to keep onwards with your investigation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, be careful with your surroundings because something might be lurking while you\u2019re not watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/6037e396402bf139e25fc7488da3a09e.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b9a140da339b9950dce97f1fe2573402.poster.avif?t=1766056130\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b9a140da339b9950dce97f1fe2573402.webm?t=1766056130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, your offensive actions are determined by the weapon you have equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can target specific parts of the enemy. When critically damaged, the limb will be lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, because some enemies change their behaviour when losing certain limbs and might become even more dangerous.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086480?t=1766056130","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/cb005167134e723ba3c92b170d1398668868e1e8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766056130","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/ad287289b993fd27624927e903f9b8764cf1877f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766056130","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/ad287289b993fd27624927e903f9b8764cf1877f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766056130","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages: Frequent violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scorched Sun is a short experience that combines top down survival horror with turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new initiate, delve into the depths of a monastery of the Scorched Sun order and discover the secrets within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b263ad728c0614692dd6f0aa348d959a.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The order has sent you to investigate why they have lost contact with a monastery set in a small village. Upon arrival, you will notice that the situation is not as simple as you thought.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/af8caa669a3effb955748d905570d0e1.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/f73eeb76c1d31eb380c37f8945a910a3.poster.avif?t=1766056130\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/f73eeb76c1d31eb380c37f8945a910a3.webm?t=1766056130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When exploring, you only see what your character can see. Explore various environments and gather resources to keep onwards with your investigation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, be careful with your surroundings because something might be lurking while you\u2019re not watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/6037e396402bf139e25fc7488da3a09e.avif?t=1766056130\" width=960 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b9a140da339b9950dce97f1fe2573402.poster.avif?t=1766056130\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/extras/b9a140da339b9950dce97f1fe2573402.webm?t=1766056130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In combat, your offensive actions are determined by the weapon you have equipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can target specific parts of the enemy. When critically damaged, the limb will be lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, because some enemies change their behaviour when losing certain limbs and might become even more dangerous.</p>","developers":["Skeleton Coffee Games"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086480/26239324a8077ed0a76154153d0567b2b62d2580/header.jpg?t=1766056130","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086480/60315113/9ba30650755ee3258fb4bbd1eb7ae06620737170/1759664164/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760686692","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086480/60315113/9ba30650755ee3258fb4bbd1eb7ae06620737170/1759664164/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760686692","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4086480/60315113/9ba30650755ee3258fb4bbd1eb7ae06620737170/1759664164/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760686692","id":257212532,"name":"Scorched Sun - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257212532/09d912d386f1b590edc8b15d46f614b1db2395f6/movie_600x337.jp